A||||11||88CoupeV6||Everyone be careful, almost lost my car :(||||9||
Z||000000||88CoupeV6||07-21-2001||10:01 AM||||I was coming home last night in my 88CoupeV6 on Rt. 140 near my house. Windows down, sunroof off, wind blowing through my hair. I was going about 75. I was in the low speed lane (2 lane highway) The guy in front of me was taking an exit. there were slow car in the left lane that were held by a slow traveling SUV. I never pass on the right and usually hate when I see people do it but, I saw a nice clear area to blow by all these cars. So I started to get by them as the SUV decided he belonged in the slow lane. He started moving over toward me, as the other car was on my right taking the exit. I was going a lot faster then they were. I hit my brakes and I broke a brake line as the peddle went to the floor. It did lock the front right witch sent the car in a major spinout. The car was going totally out of control all over the road in every direction.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> All I could see was thick smoke from the tires. I saw myself facing all the cars the wrong way <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> It finally spun into the grass divider in the center of the highway and stopped. No crash <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> The engine had stalled. It started and I drove out of there. I then was moving up to 60 mph to drive to my exit and this guy slowed down and screamed out of his car you are a ****ing idiot. I just said sorry. I was so upset I could not stop shaking. I got home slowly by using the ebrake and downshifting. I am now getting the Fierostore steal braded brake lines all the way around. I thought it was all over. I knew my car was getting totaled. I was waiting for an impact. It looked just like you see on nascar. I even pulled a muscle in my arm <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> Please drive slow and careful. <P>------------------<BR>Josh <B>(known by TheFiero64 for first 1239 posts)</B><BR>     <IMG SRC="http://people.ne.mediaone.net/fiero64/Fiero642.jpg">    <BR><A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumList?u=1249362" TARGET=_blank>My pics</A>||||reg||9
