Z||000006||FieroKyle||07-21-2001||05:54 PM||||I spun out my fiero on some banked corners racing on them one time and didn't bust it up. It was stalled too when it came to rest. Scared the hell out of me. Those damn SUVs and they don't even use their blinker or anything and just come right into you. I hate when people drive stupid on the expressways. You weren't driving too fast at all. Wasn't your fault or anything. Just a mixed up regular dumbass drivers and a brake failure. I always say while your driving, especial if you over the limit a little or a lot, watch for cops twice as much, and watch for idiots three times as much. Glad to see you and you Fiero wasn't hurt. Now you look back on it though, you gotta think that was pretty good ride spinning out. =). Yeah when the guy yeld at you, you probably could careless about him because of all the crap that went on. Keep it safe, but fun. Bye.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sign_1.jpg">  <P>My Fast 'n Black Car<BR>AOL Name: Yakty Yak<BR>E-Mail: YaktyYak@aol.com<P>Kyle - 85' GT||||reg||1
